// resources.h — Hot Fuzz control-rate LUTs, generated by tools/gen_luts.py.
//
// Two 256-entry octave-linear tables mapping control values to Braids SVF
// `frequency_` indices (the value passed to Svf::set_frequency).  The SVF
// resolves that to an `f` coefficient via Interpolate824(lut_svf_cutoff,
// frequency_ << 17), so an index in 0..32760 covers the full stable range.
//
//  - manual_freq_LUT: indexed by (Main pot >> 4), sweeps 300 Hz .. 2 kHz.
//  - env_freq_LUT:     indexed by (envelope >> 4), same sweep for auto-wah.
//
// Regenerate with:  python3 tools/gen_luts.py > resources.h

